---
const IBAN = 'ES6930080084314501920526'
---

<section class="bg-warm px-4 py-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-xl overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-accent px-8 py-10 text-center" data-animate>
        <svg class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-4 -top-2 h-20 w-20 rotate-12 opacity-15 sm:-right-2 sm:-top-1 sm:h-24 sm:w-24" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect x="10" y="35" width="80" height="55" rx="6" fill="white"/>
            <rect x="44" y="35" width="12" height="55" fill="white"/>
            <rect x="5" y="25" width="90" height="18" rx="5" fill="white"/>
            <path d="M50 25 C50 25 30 5 20 10 C10 15 25 25 50 25" fill="white"/>
            <path d="M50 25 C50 25 70 5 80 10 C90 15 75 25 50 25" fill="white"/>
        </svg>
        <svg class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-3 -left-3 h-14 w-14 -rotate-6 opacity-10 sm:-bottom-2 sm:-left-2 sm:h-16 sm:w-16" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect x="10" y="35" width="80" height="55" rx="6" fill="white"/>
            <rect x="44" y="35" width="12" height="55" fill="white"/>
            <rect x="5" y="25" width="90" height="18" rx="5" fill="white"/>
            <path d="M50 25 C50 25 30 5 20 10 C10 15 25 25 50 25" fill="white"/>
            <path d="M50 25 C50 25 70 5 80 10 C90 15 75 25 50 25" fill="white"/>
        </svg>
        <svg class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-4 right-8 h-10 w-10 rotate-6 opacity-10 sm:bottom-5 sm:right-10 sm:h-12 sm:w-12" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect x="10" y="35" width="80" height="55" rx="6" fill="white"/>
            <rect x="44" y="35" width="12" height="55" fill="white"/>
            <rect x="5" y="25" width="90" height="18" rx="5" fill="white"/>
            <path d="M50 25 C50 25 30 5 20 10 C10 15 25 25 50 25" fill="white"/>
            <path d="M50 25 C50 25 70 5 80 10 C90 15 75 25 50 25" fill="white"/>
        </svg>
        <p class="relative font-serif text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white">Regalo</p>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/90">
            Lo que de verdad nos importa es que pasemos un gran día junt@s.
            Si además queréis echarnos una mano...
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-5 py-3">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-wide text-white sm:text-sm" id="iban-text">{IBAN}</span>
            <button id="copy-iban" class="text-white/60 transition hover:text-white" title="Copiar número de cuenta">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                    <path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path>
                </svg>
            </button>
        </div>
        <p id="copy-msg" class="mt-2 hidden text-xs text-white">¡Copiado!</p>
    </div>
</section>

<script>
    document.getElementById('copy-iban')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        navigator.clipboard.writeText('ES6930080084314501920526')
        const msg = document.getElementById('copy-msg')
        msg.classList.remove('hidden')
        setTimeout(() => msg.classList.add('hidden'), 2000)
    })
</script>
